# Toby server environment template — copy to .env on the server and fill in.
# Never commit a real .env (gitignored). 密码与密钥永不入库。
# Copy as: cp env.example .env   (in the same folder as compose.server.yaml)

# No password variable: the login password is set on the first-run registration
# page (open the site within 10 minutes of the first start) and stored under ./data.
# 没有密码变量:登录密码在首次启动的注册页面设置(首次启动后 10 分钟内打开站点),
# 保存在 ./data 下。

# Do NOT set TOBY_DATA_ROOT on a server: inside the container the data root is
# always /app/data, mapped to ./data by compose.server.yaml.
# 不要设置 TOBY_DATA_ROOT:容器内数据根固定为 /app/data,
# 由 compose.server.yaml 的 ./data:/app/data 卷接管。

# Automated deployment only: pull the image from a registry instead of using
# the docker-load name. Set it to your ACR image, e.g.
#   TOBY_IMAGE=registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/toby/toby:latest
# Leave unset for the tarball (docker load) flow.
# 仅自动化部署需要:从镜像仓库拉取镜像(不设置则使用 docker load 的本地镜像)。
# 例:TOBY_IMAGE=registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/toby/toby:latest
# TOBY_IMAGE=
